	(text_box "Hall Sensor Inputs\n\nAssume VH required by motor hall sensors is 5V, but expose pad to switch to 3V3, if desired\n\nUM2896 5.4: Recommends CH1-3 of TIM3 (PB4, PB5, PB0) for HA, HB, HC\n\nOptional TEMP (MOTOR_TEMP) pin if chosen motor provides winding temps (note that this is NOT the same temp as the one in control sheet)\n\nDC12_IN6 on PC0 used for MOTOR_TEMP based on current availability\n-> Might change based on needs of ADC since other ADC inputs not yet implemented\n\nPull up resistors since sensor is open drain\n\nDiodes to clamp voltage at 3V3 to protect MCU from external noise\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 132.08 86.36 0)
		(size 35.56 61.1979)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
